{"suttaId":"tha-ap280","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[8659,8671],"vripara":"31"},"segments":{"tha-ap280:0.3":"Āluvadāyakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap280:1.1":"“Pabbate himavantamhi,","tha-ap280:1.2":"mahāsindhu sudassanā;","tha-ap280:1.3":"Tatthaddasaṃ vītarāgaṃ,","tha-ap280:1.4":"suppabhāsaṃ sudassanaṃ.","tha-ap280:2.1":"“Paramopasame yuttaṃ,","tha-ap280:2.2":"disvā vimhitamānaso;","tha-ap280:2.3":"Āluvaṃ tassa pādāsiṃ,","tha-ap280:2.4":"pasanno sehi pāṇibhi.","tha-ap280:3.1":"“Ekattiṃse ito kappe,","tha-ap280:3.2":"yaṃ phalamadadiṃ tadā;","tha-ap280:3.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi,","tha-ap280:3.4":"āluvassa idaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap280:4.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe …","tha-ap280:4.3":"kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap280:5.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā āluvadāyako thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap280:6.1":"Āluvadāyakattherassāpadānaṃ aṭṭhamaṃ."},"unsure":[],"preface":[],"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":3238,"to":3238,"paras":[{"para":3238,"vripara":"31-32","refs":["tha-ap280:1"],"lines":["31-32. Aṭṭhamāpadāne <b>mahāsindhu sudassanā</b>ti sundaradassanasundarodakadhavalapulinopasobhitattā suṭṭhu manoharā mahāsindhu nāma vārinadī ahosi.","<b>Tattha</b>tissaṃ sindhuvārinadiyaṃ <b>sappabhāsaṃ</b> pabhāya sahitaṃ <b>sudassanaṃ</b> sundararūpaṃ <b>paramopasame yuttaṃ</b> uttame upasame yuttaṃ samaṅgībhūtaṃ vītarāgaṃ ahaṃ addasanti attho.","<b>Disvāhaṃ vimhitāsayo</b>ti “evarūpaṃ bhayānakaṃ himavantaṃ kathaṃ sampatto”ti vimhitaajjhāsayo acchariyabbhutacittoti attho.","<b>Āluvaṃ tassa pādāsin</b>ti tassa arahato ahaṃ pasannamānaso āluvakandaṃ pādāsiṃ ādarena adāsinti attho."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap280:1"],["tha-ap280:1"],["tha-ap280:1"],["tha-ap280:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[["tha-ap280:1.1","mahāsindhu sudassanā",0,0],["tha-ap280:1.3","sudassanaṃ",0,1],["tha-ap280:1.3","tattha",0,1]],"after":[{"para":3239,"vripara":null,"title":"Suvaṇṇabibbohaniyattheraapadānādivaṇṇanā","lines":["Navamadasamāpadānāni uttānānevāti."]},{"para":3240,"vripara":null,"title":"Suvaṇṇabibbohaniyattheraapadānādivaṇṇanā","lines":["Aṭṭhavīsatimavaggavaṇṇanā samattā."]}]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
